qlcplus (5.3.0) stable; urgency=low

  * First QLC+ 5 debian package
  * Installs as /usr/bin/qlcplus5, with its own engine library
    (libqlcplusengine5.so) and I/O plugins directory (plugins/qlcplus5),
    so that it can be installed alongside QLC+ 4
  * Resources (fixtures, gobos, input profiles, RGB scripts, ...) are
    shared with QLC+ 4 through the qlcplus-data package

